Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Sef novi: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault šifriraj: message ključ: key.
>> decrypted := vault dešifriraj: encrypted ključ: key.

Izlaz 
piši: ['Message:'], novi-red
piši: message, novi-red
piši: ['Decrypted:'], novi-red
piši: decrypted, novi-red.
